WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.700
Let the games begin!

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.660
It's the Dahlia Academy Senior High Sports Festival!

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:11.950
The competition will span three days,
one for each grade level.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.820
Day one is the first-years!

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.660
If I'm the MVP,
you have to obey an order of mine?

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.250
Yes, that's fine.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.040
I'll secure that MVP title, and make Persia...

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.000
call me by my first name, "Romio"!

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:04.810
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:13.660
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:19.660
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:30.170
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.930
So that I can protect you

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:39.430
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:44.980
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:50.030
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:56.990
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.360
Juliet and the Sports Festival

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.400
The opening ceremony will now commence.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.640
We will hear a speech from each of the housemasters.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:13.150
Housemaster
Black Doggy House

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.910
Good afternoon. It's an a-auspicious day.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.410
You got to have s-sportsmanship.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:28.920
I want you to f-fight fair and square, g-got it?

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.510
That is all.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.290
What did he just say?

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.800
Your enunciation is as pitiful as ever.

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.370
Housemaster
White Cats House

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:36.920
Now withdraw!
White Cats House
Housemaster

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.680
Annoying n-no good hag...

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.930
You just muttered something under your breath!
Say it to my face!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.930
-Inuzuka, I'm in the first event.
-That concludes the ceremony!

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.180
Hurry, hurry!

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.120
Aby and Somali!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.940
How precious of you to come running to my chest.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.600
It's really too bad.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.400
Perhaps if you weren't
one of those black doggies--

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.460
Stay the hell away from Hasuki...

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.830
you perverted creep.

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.580
-We meet again, Inuzuka--
-You adulterer!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:12.520
-It's always other girls, with you! Stupid Aby!
-You can't hit on our idol.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.850
-I'll kill you!
-Give it your best shot.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.590
-Dummy! Dummy!
-You might not have to!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.090
Well, isn't this is the perfect opportunity?

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:24.100
Today we'll make it clear
that the White Cats are superior.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.470
They sure can hiss. Let's make them regret it.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:32.120
Things are already heating up
before the match has even begun!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:36.660
One MVP from each grade will be chosen
from the winning house.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:39.740
Do your best and aim for the MVP title!

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.570
The MVP will be...

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:44.070
Me!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:48.330
Now, the first scheduled event, the tug-of-war.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.960
The chosen power-fighters will go head to head.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.260
Inuzuka, go get them!

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:56.560
Tosa, fight! Come on Maru, cheer them on.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:57.710
Why would I? Dumbass!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.310
Do your best, everyone!

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:02.020
Scott! If you lose, you'll be shaved clean!

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.720
-That's a harsh punishment!
-On your marks.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.570
-Try to at least be useful.
-Ready...

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:07.720
With ease.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.520
It's one-sided for the Black Doggies!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.950
-Let's go!
-You're useless!

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.950
Well, that'd be because I do zero exercise.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.370
So, what did you intend to do "with ease"?

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.650
It's fine.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:23.380
We have as our anchor...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:26.160
Somali!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.860
This girl really does have some incredible power.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:33.040
Amazing, Somali!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.040
She's taking on the Black Doggies alone!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.790
With a small frame like that,
where does her power come from?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:41.050
Good work, Somali! Keep it up!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.800
Yay! Aby praised me!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.110
Don't let go, idiot!

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.820
-I'm so happy!
-Black Doggies win!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.060
The second event is the athletic course.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.440
Who will complete the specially
made course the fastest?

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.790
I won't be holding back, Miss Princess.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.070
Well, how gentlemanly of you.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.820
You got this, Char!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.320
Ready!

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.870
It looks like Maru has an early lead!

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:13.180
The first course segment is the log bridge.

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:16.750
All the runners must run atop this bridge.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.860
Take this, Princess! Glass spike trap!

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.310
That's custom-made, extra-sharp glass.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:26.590
How will you run across that
with your delicate feet?

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:30.270
-I stepped on something!
-She's not doing the running!

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.950
Run with your own legs!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.910
No way! I'll get tired if I run.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:37.830
-That's right!
-We can't allow Princess Char to tire herself!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.730
This is a sports festival! Ref, are you not seeing this?

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.610
-I'll allow it.
-Have you been bribed, you bastard?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.740
Maru! This isn't the time to chew out the ref!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.630
The White Cats win by a lot!

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.260
What?

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.560
Char, that was incredible!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.350
Maru, you really gave him an earful!

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.500
Shut up!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.510
Girls' 100-meter race, Persia wins by a wide margin!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:18.280
And the boys' 100-meter race is won by Inuzuka!

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.650
He's made up for last year's disgrace!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:27.460
That wraps up the first half of the contest.
We'll now have a one-hour break.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:31.780
The scores are even,
so the victors will be decided in the second half!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.720
This really is tiring.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.510
Damn, I had planned to win this with ease.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:43.550
My, I couldn't let you do that.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.400
Today, in the stands...

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.930
My mother is sitting up there.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:55.430
Meaning that if I get MVP, she'll tell my father about it.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:02.460
So, I can't afford to lose. Not to you or anyone else.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.690
Neither can I.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.000
Wait, so should I introduce myself to your mother?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.250
You don't have to!

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.700
-You can do that down the road.
-I see.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.200
Down the road?

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.710
So, does that mean...?

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.810
Let's go! The second half is about to start!

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.460
Wait!

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.970
Let the second half begin!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.220
Attention, guys!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.970
It's a cheer battle between the girls!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.220
Go get them, go get them, Black Doggies!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.620
You can do it, you can do it, White Cats!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.730
It's hard to say which is the winner.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:48.580
There are only three games left!
Who will claim the glory?

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:50.110
It's time.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.170
The seventh event is the "Stick Down"!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:56.410
This grueling offensive and defensive game
plays like a battlefield!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.370
Does the Black Doggies boys' team
have a slight advantage?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.980
Then there's the girls' match!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.790
Jumping fearlessly into enemy lines is...

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.420
Persia!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:13.590
She's grabbed on to the pole! But it still won't fall!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.600
It appears Somali has come to the rescue.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.780
The pole is falling!

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.600
Somali! Thank--!

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.100
It's time.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:27.110
Sorry to leave this to you. Can you do it?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.170
Aby is my god.

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:36.490
I'll do anything for you.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:41.450
Sorry about this, Persia.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.330
The White Cats girls' team is victorious!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.090
And what about the boys?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:54.520
I can't believe it! A simultaneous knock down!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:59.350
The panel is calling it a draw!
Both boys' teams get 50 points!

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:04.480
The current score is 250 for the Black Doggies,
and 300 for the White Cats.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.980
This is largely thanks to the efforts of Persia and Somali.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:11.380
They've both made a good case for MVP.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.000
Per, are you okay?

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.130
What was that...?

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:18.120
What do you mean?

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:23.750
Now with the White Cats in the lead,
we move on to the coed relay.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.370
If the White Cats win this, their victory is assured.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.750
The anchors must be feeling the pressure!

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.250
I won't lose.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:36.150
I can't ever lose to you, Persia.

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.610
You listening?

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.020
You're yelling in my ear.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:46.520
I don't want to lose to you either, Hasuki.

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.900
The relay is entering the final phase!

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.150
The race is in a neck and neck dead heat!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.920
The batons have been passed to the anchors.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:58.530
The match is now one last kick
between Hasuki and Persia!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.410
Go, big sis Hasuki!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.910
You can do it, Miss Persia!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.540
A fiery dash from Hasuki!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.980
But now...

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:13.550
Persia takes the lead!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.930
Miss Persia!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.430
Persia? She looks sort of...

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.930
Can Persia keep this lead?

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.220
Inuzuka!

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:51.040
Hold it.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:56.270
Lady Persia!

00:10:56.270 --> 00:11:00.730
If you go out there,
you'll only put her even further in a corner.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:04.350
I know how you feel, but you have to restrain yourself.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.980
Lady Persia! Bring a stretcher, quick!

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:10.490
Don't make such a fuss, Scott. I just tripped is all.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:12.740
-But--
-I'm fine.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:15.210
I can endure this much...

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:19.540
Oh, no. What are you doing, Persia?

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.870
Because of you, everything we've been working for
is dust in the wind.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:28.510
You've let us all down. I don't need to tell you
the kind of chance you've wasted--

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:30.850
You knave!

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.500
You all feel the same, don't you?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.770
-Completely.
-Persia's such a letdown.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.510
In the end, she's just a fragile girl.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:42.260
-You think you're cut out to lead the White Cats?
-Are these guys Aby's...?

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:47.150
-That's right!
-To be done in by a little stumble!

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.520
This isn't some everyday sports festival!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.020
-Where's your spirit?
-You're a weak link!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.410
Don't enter if you're not going to try!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.790
That's right!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.780
Silence, you gawkers!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.470
Was this your doing?

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:11.290
What are you talking about?

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.790
You will regret this.

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:17.800
Now, that's terrifying.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:23.160
All as planned, so far.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.490
If we can just defeat Inuzuka in the Cavalry Battle,

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.780
we'll be one step closer to realizing it.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:30.930
Yes.

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:35.940
Multiple lacerations and bruises to the instep.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:39.940
There's no way you can return to the tournament.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:44.420
Just wait it out for now.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:48.700
What am I...?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.460
I couldn't even go to Persia's side when she fell.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:57.090
Persia was in trouble, and I couldn't help her at all.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.610
This wasn't an accident.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.220
I saw it.

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:10.060
The moment Somali stepped on Per's foot.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.660
And Somali only does what Aby tells her.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.870
Aby is waging a faction war with Persia
over the White Cats.

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:25.070
I'm sure this is part of a scheme
to cause Persia's faction to collapse all at once.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.070
Him?

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:31.640
But I have no proof.
If they simply insist it was an accident...

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.960
I've got no rebuttal.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:38.960
The one who's powerless here is me.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.710
So, Inuzuka...

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:47.550
If I become MVP, then maybe my father...

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.060
So I can't afford to lose. Not to you or anyone else.

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:55.160
I'm weak... aren't I?

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.370
All I do is lose.

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:02.630
How could someone so pathetic change the world?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.090
It stings.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:08.490
It stings...

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:13.050
It stings!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.640
Persia!

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:20.500
If the pain subsides, come watch the match.

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:24.200
And dry up your tears first.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.510
I'm not crying.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.610
If you don't...

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.510
You won't be able to see me...

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.010
mop the floor with this guy.

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:47.630
We've finally come to the final event, the Cavalry Battle!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:50.630
-Hey, Inuzuka. Hunch over already.
-The mounts have taken shape!

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:53.660
-You're part of the horse.
-The remaining house will claim victory!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.410
The Black Doggies and White Cats
are tied at 300 points.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.290
Whoever wins this match wins it all!

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:05.300
I will win. Using whatever means necessary.
I'll make sure we ascend the ladder.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.610
-I will...
-Let's do this, Inuzuka!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:10.300
Yeah, right!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.560
Why do you get to ride on top? Get off!

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:16.200
What are those two doing?

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.200
Let the games begin!

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.950
Maru, it's started! We'll just have to go like this.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.440
Just get off already!

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.830
Please, Maru.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:26.940
Leave the...

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.200
beating of that guy to me!

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:32.380
Inuzuka is...

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.200
Asking Maru for a favor?

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.200
Like I'd let you do that. I'd sooner kill you.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.430
Hey! Don't put your head down!

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:42.210
I'd rather die than be your horse!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.590
So, I'm not moving. Figure something out on your own!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.350
Now's not the time for this!

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:51.340
-It's only a problem because you said you wouldn't enter.
-Inuzuka's horse isn't cooperating?

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:55.470
Meanwhile, a fierce battle is unfolding!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:16:00.530
The ones making the most impact are Hasuki's unit!

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:03.230
They're taking out the White Cats one after another!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.480
-Hasuki!
-Scott!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.850
I'll win this in Persia's honor!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.360
You're finished!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:13.920
Watch your hands! That's sexual harassment!
Four-eyed sex offender!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.740
There's no sexual harassment in a match!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.240
What an empty accusation!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:22.060
-Hasuki is pretty strong, after all.
-Yes.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.750
But it's about time...

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.350
-What is it?
-Sorry.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.380
My mind went blank all of a sudden.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.890
-Got it!
-Oh, no!

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:39.280
That's no good, Scott.
You can't be struggling against such a tepid opponent.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.390
This guy...

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.900
Hasuki faces a shocking elimination!

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.150
A tough blow to the Black Doggies!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:51.710
Like breaking open a dam,
the Black Doggies are falling one by one!

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.150
Black Doggies are in trouble!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.530
What the heck? What's going on?

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:02.460
You thoroughly trapped little Black Doggies...

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.220
What's happening?

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:07.540
Kohitsuji and Tosa are suddenly down!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:11.270
Hey, these guys are sleeping! Wake up!

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.430
-Can Inuzuka's unit continue like this?
-We'll be just fine!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:18.780
-Those guys are out cold.
-Did we screw up the amount?

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:21.700
It was supposed to be just enough
to make them sleepy.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:25.190
No matter. We already control the game.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.440
Now we'll just take down Inuzuka's unit.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.990
The Black Doggies have three units remaining
against the White Cats' 10.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:33.190
The Black Doggies are completely outnumbered!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:36.200
Inuzuka's unit is in the worst possible place!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.070
Hey, move! We're going to lose!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.830
Quiet. Figure something out yourself.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.700
You're asking the impossible!

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.830
This is bad.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:50.960
Don't give up!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.220
Julio?

00:17:56.480 --> 00:18:00.040
You're a failure as a leader of the White Cats.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.910
Persia came to cheer me on.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.730
He's cheering for me.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.980
Think you have time to be distracted? I've got you!

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:19.170
Hey, Inuzuka. If you slow me down, I'll kill you.

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:23.750
That'd be you. You took forever to get fired up.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.370
Only two left! They're helpless!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.000
We'll overwhelm them with numbers!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.750
They don't get it.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:34.510
Those two will never see eye to eye,
but they're both at the top of the first-years in strength.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:38.010
If the two of them cooperate...

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:41.010
No one can stop them!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:48.270
We're finally down to a one on one game!
There's serious pressure on Aby's unit!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:52.580
Don't get cocky! I've assembled a team
with outstanding physical prowess.

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.460
We won't be captured by the likes of--

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.780
-What?
-What's this?

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.530
-Two from Aby's unit fell!
-Wait...

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:03.520
-Why are you two here? You're supposed to be asleep!
-What's going on?

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.660
A stun gun?

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:08.050
Hey, ref! These guys!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:10.540
Don't be so cold.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.440
You're the one who went and set a trap.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:19.180
There was a characteristic bitterness
to the drinks the water boy brought us.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:23.180
I knew right away that it was a sleeping drug.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:27.230
Since I possess the very same one.

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:30.530
Once I found and threatened that water boy,

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:32.620
he spilled the beans real quick.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.320
He told me you're the offender!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.330
I could've exposed you, too.

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:43.320
But I have an addiction that I just can't kick.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:49.680
It's witnessing the broken spirit of someone
whose hubris comes crumbling down around them!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.580
You're really enjoying this, aren't you?

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.020
It's okay! Aby can't lose.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.560
Somali will protect you!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:06.560
These shoes harmed Persia...

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:11.560
Hey, Aby. All these cheap tricks of yours are getting old.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.560
Come at me yourself.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:17.200
Cheap, you say?

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.070
What do you know?

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:22.070
You, who were blessed with strength!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.880
This world is a class-based society.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:28.580
Your looks and intelligence are decided from birth.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:33.080
The lower class is looked down upon,
criticized, and blamed!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:37.850
Weaklings living in that class
have no choice but to become underhanded.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:42.230
I will pull us up the ladder.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:48.460
I'll outdo Persia, defeat Inuzuka, and claim MVP. Then...

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:52.320
I will be chosen by the elites that everyone looks up to!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:55.730
I can't afford to lose here!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.090
You just don't shut up.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:05.240
My fury has reached its greatest limit.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.740
Why don't you just go on...

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.370
and die already!

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:21.710
He threw Aby into the stands with just one hand!

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.900
As of now, the Black Doggies' victory is--

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:26.970
Not yet! It's not over yet!

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:31.570
Beating a weakling like him hardly feels like a win.

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.850
There's someone we haven't defeated yet!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:36.860
Persia! Get out here!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:43.660
If I don't take you down,
I can't call it a complete victory against the White Cats!

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:47.240
-What are you saying? Are you dumb?
-You're the dumb one.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.170
-They'll say, "Persia wasn't there. It doesn't count."
-Inuzuka...

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:53.750
We'll make our victory absolutely clear.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:57.100
That fool! What in the world is he thinking?

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.630
Char, please...

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:02.230
lend me your strength.

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:08.140
Unheard of!

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:10.650
This overtime is unprecedented!

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:12.360
With the permission of both houses,

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:15.780
the fated showdown between Inuzuka and Persia
has come to fruition!

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:20.620
The match's outcome will be decided by these two pairs!

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:48.730
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:56.740
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:56.910 --> 00:23:04.040
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:10.670
I want to match the love you have for me

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:18.890
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:19.050 --> 00:23:25.230
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:32.480
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:34.690
I want to support you

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:42.530
With everything I have

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:50.630
Until the world can one day change

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:57.550
Everyone,
t-thank you for watching t-this week. Now then...

00:23:57.550 --> 00:23:59.840
No one understands what you're saying.

00:23:59.840 --> 00:24:01.870
Next time, "Romio and Juliet and the Sports Festival"!
You'd better watch it!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.560
Romio and Juliet and the Sports Festival

00:24:03.560 --> 00:24:06.650
Don't interrupt me! You accursed n-no good hag!

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:07.000
Romio and Juliet and the Sports Festival
